                    <span class="pill">Characteristics</span>
                    <span class="pill">Service per business capability</span>
                    <span class="pill">Database per service</span>
                    <span class="pill">Sync and async communication</span>
                    <span class="pill">Loose coupling and high cohesion</span>
                    <span class="pill">Scalability and fault isolation</span>
                    <span class="pill">Monolith vs Microservices</span>
